></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"WorkerCard-MainRight\"><div><div class=\"Row Row_wrap_no Row_justify_between Gap\"><div class=\"WorkerCard-Titles\"><span class=\"TextCut\"><span class=\"Text Text_fontSize_xl Text_lineHeight_xl Text_weight_bold TextCut-Text\"><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"Link WorkerCard-Title WorkerCard-Title_withLabel\" href=\"/profile/SergejS-292872?isPromotion=1&amp;occupationId=%2Fremont-i-stroitel_stvo&amp;specId=%2Fremont-i-stroitel_stvo%2Fpotolki&amp;text=%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8F%D0%B6%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5+%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B8\">Сергей С.</a><a class=\"Link PromotionLabel-Handler WorkerCard-PromotionLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"YdoIcon PromotionLabel-Icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"YdoIcon-Svg YdoIcon-Svg_size_s\" fill=\"#49b530\"><path d=\"M8 16a8 8 0 10-6.274-3.036l5.207-5.208-2.546-1.569 7.52-2.378-2.378 7.52-1.47-2.385-5.192 5.193A7.968 7.968 0 008 16z\"></path></svg></span></a></span></span><div class=\"WorkerCard-Subtitle\"><span class=\"SplittedItems SplittedItems_centering WorkerGeo WorkerCard-Geo\"><span class=\"SplittedItems-Item WorkerGeo-Item\"><div class=\"WorkerGeo-Address WorkerGeo-Address_red\">Дмитровский городской округ</div></span><span class=\"SplittedItems-Divider SplittedItems-Divider_color_gray\">&nbsp;<!-- -->·<!-- --> </span><span class=\"SplittedItems-Item WorkerGeo-Item\"><span><span class=\"Text Text_fontSize_s Text_lineHeight_m Text_color_greyDark WorkerCard-LastVisit\">В&nbsp;сети&nbsp;<!-- -->1&nbsp;д.&nbsp;назад</span></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"IconWithTooltip ExtrasHandler WorkerCard-Complain\"><span class=\"YdoIcon IconWithTooltip-Icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" class=\"YdoIcon-Svg YdoIcon-Svg_size_s\"><path d=\"M10.875 15a1.874 1.874 0 11-3.749.001A1.874 1.874 0 0110.875 15zm0-5.906a1.874 1.874 0 11-3.749 0 1.874 1.874 0 013.749 0zm0-6.094a1.874 1.874 0 11-3.749.001A1.874 1.874 0 0110.875 3z\"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"WorkerCard-TextWrap\"><span class=\"TextCut WorkerCardDescription-Text\"><span class=\"Text Text_fontSize_s Text_lineHeight_ms TextCut-Text WorkerCardDescription-Text\">Производство и установка мягких окон с 2016 года!\nЗанимаюсь установкой натяжных потолков с 2011 года!\nИсп...<!-- -->&nbsp;<a class=\"Link WorkerCardDescription-TextLink\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Читать ещё</a></span></span></div><div class=\"SeoText\">Работаю в сфере натяжных потолков уже 11 лет, знаю множество нюансов.\nВсегда смогу подсказать какой материал выбрать, какое подобрать освещение и как ухаживать за натяжным потолком.\nРаботаю на совесть, лучшая реклама - это совет знакомым!</div><div class=\"WorkerSpecializationDiscount WorkerSpecializationDiscount_size_s Gap Gap_top_l Gap_bottom_l\"><div class=\"WorkerSpecializationDiscount-Title\"><span class=\"YdoIcon WorkerSpecializationDiscount-Icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 15\" class=\"YdoIcon-Svg YdoIcon-Svg_size_s\" fill=\"#0eb23c\"><path d=\"M7.762.907c-.348 0-.681.14-.927.385L.71 7.417a1.312 1.312 0 000 1.855L5.634 14.2a1.313 1.313 0 001.857 0l6.125-6.125a1.312 1.312 0 00.384-.93V1.782a.875.875 0 00-.875-.875H7.762zm3.613 3.938a1.313 1.313 0 11-2.625 0 1.313 1.313 0 012.625 0z\"></path></svg></span>Бесплатно</div><div class=\"WorkerSpecializationDiscount-Text\">В подарок ставлю резиновый плинтус по периметру!</div></div><div class=\"PhotoGallery PhotoGallery_withScroller WorkerCard-PhotoGallery\"><div class=\"PhotoGallery-Thumbnails\"><div class=\"Scroller Scroller_scrollDirection_right Scroller_expanded Scroller_view_withShadow\"><div class=\"Scroller-Container\"><div class=\"Scroller-Wrap\"><div class=\"Scroller-Item\"><a class=\"Link PhotoGallery-Image PhotoGallery-Image_gap_m\"><span class=\"Thumb Thumb_overlay PhotoGallery-Thumb\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:64px;height:64px\"></span></a></div><div class=\"Scroller-Item\"><a class=